flowchart TD
    subgraph Client [Client Tier]
        Desktop[Desktop Browser]
        MobileApp[Mobile App iOS/Android]
    end

    subgraph Edge [Edge & CDN]
        CDN[CDN CloudFront / Vercel Edge]
        WAF[WAF / API Gateway]
    end

    subgraph Services [Microservices Backend]
        SearchSvc[Search Service]
        BookingSvc[Booking & Reservation]
        UserSvc[User & Auth Service]
        MsgSvc[Messaging Service]
        ListingSvc[Listing Service]
    end

    subgraph Data [Data & Storage Tier]
        Elastic[(Elasticsearch Cluster)]
        Redis[(Redis Cache)]
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL RDBMS)]
        Mongo[(MongoDB NoSQL)]
        S3[S3 Object Storage]
    end

    Desktop --> CDN
    MobileApp --> CDN
    CDN --> WAF
    WAF --> SearchSvc
    WAF --> BookingSvc
    WAF --> UserSvc
    WAF --> MsgSvc
    WAF --> ListingSvc

    SearchSvc <--> Elastic
    ListingSvc <--> Mongo
    ListingSvc --> S3
    BookingSvc <--> Postgres
    UserSvc <--> Postgres
    MsgSvc <--> Postgres

    SearchSvc -.-> Redis
    ListingSvc -.-> Redis
    BookingSvc -.-> Redis
